<view class="page journal-page">
  <view class="journal-heading"><text class="eyebrow">自然问答 · 我的对话</text><view class="page-title">把好奇，留在这里。</view><view class="subtitle">那些关于花、河流与远方的问题。</view><view class="journal-leaf"></view></view>
  <view class="journal-note"><text class="note-mark">✦</text><text>从识别结果、生态导览或科普智游开启对话，在这里继续聊。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{status && !status.enabled}}" class="notice"><view class="title">AI 暂未开放</view><view class="copy">当前不能发送新问题，已有会话仍可查看。</view></view><view wx:if="{{statusError}}" class="error-inline">服务状态暂不可用：{{statusError}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn && !loading}}" class="card section"><view class="title">登录后查看自己的对话</view><view class="copy">记录仅本人可见，可随时删除。</view><button class="primary gap" bindtap="login">去登录</button></view>
  <page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" empty="{{loggedIn && !loading && !error && !sessions.length}}" empty-text="还没有 AI 对话。去识别一朵花，或从喜欢的科普文章开始。" bindretry="load" />
  <block wx:if="{{loggedIn && !loading}}"><view wx:if="{{sessions.length}}" class="section-head section"><text class="section-title">对话手记</text><text class="small muted">仅本人可见</text></view><view wx:for="{{sessions}}" wx:key="id" class="card session-card"><view class="session-main" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="session-symbol">✦</view><view class="grow"><text class="pill">{{item.kind_label}}</text><view class="title gap">{{item.title}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{item.created_label}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.is_recognition}}" class="image-status">{{item.include_image ? (item.image_available ? '附图解读' : '原图已不可用，可继续文字对话') : '文字结果解读'}}</view><view class="session-footer"><text class="small muted">保留至 {{item.expires_label}}</text><button class="text-button delete-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{moreError}}" class="error-inline">{{moreError}}</view><button wx:if="{{next}}" class="secondary gap" loading="{{loadingMore}}" disabled="{{loadingMore || busy}}" bindtap="more">查看更多对话</button></block>
  <view class="footer-note" wx:if="{{sessions.length}}">一个问题，也是一颗新知的种子</view>
</view>
